# inengine/calendar-google-adapter (Calendar adapter)

- Informal name: **Calendar adapter** — same as this module/repo (`InEngine/Calendar-Google-Adapter`).
- PHP `^8.5`; depends on **`inengine/calendar`**.
- Implement Google Calendar as a **provider** for the base Calendar contracts. Keep LTC Blade/widgets in the host app.
- Path/repo folder and GitHub repo: **`Calendar-Google-Adapter`**; Composer: **`inengine/calendar-google-adapter`**.
- Read **`.cursor/SESSION_HANDOFF.md`** at the start of substantive work (includes the two-package idea sketch).
